{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3001_p", "source_sha256": "f699e4248f77917e2ab6ce3d4c5360bf4d180d7c6cbd9b5da664597324c39d34", "ja": "今日やよいが出るのは、全国放送される話題の\nドラマだ。765プロ代表として、しっかり頼むぞ！", "zh": "今天弥生要演出在全国播放的热门戏剧。\n作为765艺能的代表，就麻烦你好好表现啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3002_005yay", "source_sha256": "36d5b43ad5b64e1754dc4becdb6bc58d61c7cc20f5e8c66ac90999d261caca18", "ja": "は、はいっ！\nが、がんばります！　だ、大丈夫ですっ！", "zh": "好、好的！\n我、我会加油！没、没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3003_p", "source_sha256": "7068d023cbc273e63de757acf0550254f6006338e5171aaf2a8b348b0732415b", "ja": "（……しまった、あんまり大丈夫じゃなさそうだ。\nここは緊張をほぐすために……！）", "zh": "（……糟糕，她看来不像是没问题。\n这时候应该要缓解她的紧张……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3004", "source_sha256": "7961b2bdbe36b2790ae12b8f0dccd9fa5139f7bb123d8f7c56793d2998030fa1", "ja": "肩を叩く", "zh": "搥肩膀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3005", "source_sha256": "247b5f7a2a0fc47e5f2ebf6338bc15cb35ec010376d4d0d34531d7a254b77847", "ja": "台本を読む", "zh": "读剧本", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3200_p", "source_sha256": "80fae0762773e0e3f8be5e1f844bcc28097ceb24cacbb3e6114c63554e6f92bb", "ja": "やよい。まずはリラックスだ。\nほら、肩の力を抜いて。トントントン……。", "zh": "弥生，先放轻松。\n来，肩膀放松。（咚咚咚……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3201_005yay", "source_sha256": "dabb300260d5b5b71221272544ef1f27910fd2371aa59707705149377641dfe9", "ja": "わぁ……ありがとうございます～。\nあっ、でも肩たたきは、私も上手なんですよ！", "zh": "哇……谢谢你～\n啊，不过我也很擅长替人搥肩膀喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3202_005yay", "source_sha256": "c9607cfae221f40019a3dea6797a9d174240b4e47e2ce550d911d21372c773a8", "ja": "あとで{$P$}にやってあげますね！\nトントントーン、トントトトーン♪って。えへへっ！", "zh": "我之后再帮{$P$}搥喔！\n咚咚咚～咚咚咚～♪就像这样，嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3203_p", "source_sha256": "0811d7c12d1b373a8bdcee9f9fbcab8067739782ef64ae79de229fc18146dfa1", "ja": "（得意なことを思い出して、緊張は解けたらしい。\nやよいらしい笑顔を、全国に届けられそうだ！）", "zh": "（想起自己擅长的事情，似乎缓解了她的紧张。\n看来能让全国观众看到充满弥生风格的笑容了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3300_p", "source_sha256": "80fae0762773e0e3f8be5e1f844bcc28097ceb24cacbb3e6114c63554e6f92bb", "ja": "やよい。まずはリラックスだ。\nほら、肩の力を抜いて。トントントン……。", "zh": "弥生，先放轻松。\n来，肩膀放松。（咚咚咚……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3301_005yay", "source_sha256": "057f4c57a8c9dfc78492627a0476db25513ee790b35ff351f5eb4b5bd8acf730", "ja": "わぁ、ありがとうございま……はわっ！？", "zh": "哇……谢谢你～哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3302_p", "source_sha256": "7f6478a12a92348a4b7c41837e5478d6dbece24871b8c4c665cfad2614671d3d", "ja": "あれ？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3303_005yay", "source_sha256": "f3a10061e8ddc61183fde979d4b3f59b81fdd741d83cd90001de2d43171853b1", "ja": "お父さんが言ってました～。肩を叩かれた人は、\n次の日から、会社に行かなくてよくなるんだって……。", "zh": "爸爸跟我说过～被拍肩膀的人，\n隔天就不用去上班了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3304_005yay", "source_sha256": "601386d7d2d6e92f92bc732321f44f019a3b5aa1aa366d3c7ff87c858099846f", "ja": "もしかして、私……\n明日から撮影に来なくていいんですか～？", "zh": "难道说，我……\n明天起就不需要来拍摄了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3305_p", "source_sha256": "70eaa150018e5f65224822bc226045acefa922d3766faf92212bda9fed3d54b3", "ja": "（身体をふるふる震わせて訴えている。\nこれは緊張ではなく、恐怖……！？）", "zh": "（她全身都在颤抖。\n这不是紧张，而是因为害怕……！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3500_p", "source_sha256": "428ec79a69bd109f13f4d3381ac2b5ab7a66a4aab8b02b24936bdbc552baaa6b", "ja": "よし。本番まで少し時間があるし、\nよかったら、台本読みに付きあうぞ。", "zh": "好，离正式拍摄还有点时间，\n不介意的话，我可以陪你读剧本。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3501_005yay", "source_sha256": "7277b53ee05e77046384af2d6c72eaa14d3ae1a873c56505019ad7b835a52127", "ja": "えっ、本当ですか？　ありがとうございますー。\nじゃあ……、私の同級生役、お願いできますか？", "zh": "咦，真的吗？谢谢你──\n那……可以麻烦你演我的同学吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3502_005yay", "source_sha256": "9afb5496c896b6c4082c49ac6d22bf3093f3687c1347cc0731c94e32be9d5bc9", "ja": "{$P$}が同級生なんて、\nなんか楽しいかも。よろしくお願いしますねっ！", "zh": "跟{$P$}当同学，\n感觉会很开心呢。麻烦你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3503_p", "source_sha256": "2529456618e2460e4f321fe62b393234181be230dbd84cb04e11cd18add48664", "ja": "（俺のヘタな演技が功を奏して、笑顔が戻った。\nさあ、本番で本領発揮してもらおう！）", "zh": "（我的拙劣演技派上用场，让她重拾笑容了。\n弥生，接下来就在正式拍摄中发挥真本事吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3600_p", "source_sha256": "428ec79a69bd109f13f4d3381ac2b5ab7a66a4aab8b02b24936bdbc552baaa6b", "ja": "よし。本番まで少し時間があるし、\nよかったら、台本読みに付きあうぞ。", "zh": "好，离正式拍摄还有点时间，\n不介意的话，我可以陪你读剧本。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3601_005yay", "source_sha256": "9c632743956dd97c1ee020964248aeda9a6917cbaa1211f4b4df6ba1aaf62d27", "ja": "うう、そうですよね。\n本番まで、少し時間が……。少しだけ……。", "zh": "呜呜，说得也是。\n离正式拍摄还有一点时间……只有一点时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3602_005yay", "source_sha256": "14057686b461839525ecaad1f9d6a74bafbea745ca319527bd5cff8b00218f66", "ja": "台本っ、台本いっぱい読まなくちゃ！\n{$P$}、早くしてください～！", "zh": "得、得多读读剧本才行！\n{$P$}，请你快一点～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_3603_p", "source_sha256": "ed892871a5091274099945fe72c85d5c2a270ff4797316b89f3089eaf2ef0a0b", "ja": "（焦りが焦りを呼ぶ結果に。イマイチだったな……）", "zh": "（她因为过于紧张，结果表现马马虎虎……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
